<title>HONG KONG: Fu Hui interim net loss HK$8.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Fu Hui interim net loss HK$8.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.32 loss  vs 0.12</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  12.60 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    8.90 loss  vs 0.45</p>
<p>    Turnover		     317.94     vs 104.28</p>
<p>    Company name		 Fu Hui Jewellery Co (H.K.) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Fu Hui makes jewellery for overseas markets.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of fixed assets and disposal of interest in an associated company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
